        WordPress web design<br />
        that actually<br />
        <span class="text-gray-400">earns its keep.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
        If your site is slow, invisible on Google, or not bringing in enquiries
        — there are three paths forward. The right one depends on where you are
        now.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
