          >
            There's a limit to how fast<br />WordPress can go.
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
            You can cache it. Optimise images. Strip plugins. And it'll still be
            slower than a custom coded website built with modern tools. That's
            not opinion — it's architecture. WordPress rebuilds every page from
            a database, every time. A modern site serves pre-built pages
