              Midland Oil Group
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-lg font-heading font-bold text-cyan-600">
              8.4s → 0.4s
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
              Decades in the lubricant industry. Solid reputation. But their
